        {
          "id": 2010425816,
          "type": "DiscussionNote",
          "body": "I updated to `TShark (Wireshark) 4.3.1 (v4.3.1rc0-78-ge9a42a9fd6de)` and tried building the documentation, but got 180 instances of these types of warnings for both the user and developer guides now:\n\n       (CustomBuild target) ->\n         CUSTOMBUILD : warning : The following text could not be fully converted to the Windows-1252 character set: [path\\to\\build\\directory\\x64\\master\\docbook\\user_guide_pdf.vcxproj]\n\nI upgraded asciidoctorj via Chocolatey using `-pre`, so I'm now using:\n\n    AsciidoctorJ 2.5.13 (Asciidoctor 2.0.23) [https://asciidoctor.org]\n    Runtime Environment: jruby 9.4.7.0 (3.1.4)\n\n... but upgrading did not resolve these new warnings, and the formatting of the produced guides is now a mess.\n\nI guess I'm still missing something.  I'm still only following the [developer guide instructions](https://www.wireshark.org/docs/wsdg_html_chunked/ChSetupWindows.html#ChSetupAsciidoctor).",
