        {
          "id": 2010531018,
          "type": "DiscussionNote",
          "body": "Hmm, odd. I am getting the correctly formatted guide (including the arrowhead symbols) with the AsciidoctorJ 2.5.13 package from Chocolately and the standard developer guide instructions. Works both in cmd.exe as well as PowerShell.\n\nVaguely similar to (https://github.com/asciidoctor/asciidoctor-pdf/issues/612 and https://github.com/asciidoctor/asciidoctor-pdf/issues/308). Some comments in there imply that perhaps the wrong fonts are being used.\n\nPerhaps CMake is caching some wrong information? Have you tried deleting `CMakeCache.txt` in the build directory and re-rerunning CMake? (Or perhaps this is a fresh build directory already.)",
